{
  "id": "disk_brakes___torque_and_force",
  "title": "Disk Brakes - Torque and Force",
  "description": "Forces and torque activated with disk brakes. Calculate braking torque capacity and required pad pressure.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Disk Brakes - Torque and Force\n\nThe torque capacity of a disk brake with two pads can be expressed as:\n\n**T = 2 μ F r** (1)\n\nWhere:\n- T = braking torque (Nm)\n- μ = coefficient of friction\n- F = force on each pad (N)\n- r = mean radius (from center wheel to center pad) (m)\n\nRequired pad pressure can be expressed as:\n\n**p = F / A** (2)\n\nWhere:\n- p = pressure (Pa)\n- A = pad area (m²)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Braking Torque",
        "Pad Pressure"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "coefficient_of_friction",
          "label": "Coefficient of Friction (μ)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.4,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "force_per_pad",
          "label": "Force on Each Pad (F)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000,
          "unit": "N"
        },
        {
          "id": "mean_radius",
          "label": "Mean Radius (r)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.15,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "pad_area",
          "label": "Pad Area (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.025,
          "unit": "m²"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "braking_torque",
          "label": "Braking Torque (T)",
          "formula": "2 * inputs.coefficient_of_friction * inputs.force_per_pad * inputs.mean_radius",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pad_pressure",
          "label": "Pad Pressure (p)",
          "formula": "inputs.force_per_pad / inputs.pad_area",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}